    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n99866" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεισ-άγω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bring in together</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐπιτήδεια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					3.2.24
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἱερὰ ὀφειλήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PEleph.</u>
					26.6
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἔχθρα ς. τῷ μίσει φθόνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.91b
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Placit.</u>
				1.27.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hierocl.
				<u>in CA</u>
				6p.428M.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				22p.468M.
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυροῦ [ἀρτάβας] ς. τῇ ἐφετείᾳ
					φορολογίᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					1760.28
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>:— 
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾧ συνεισάγεται</span>
			<i>in</i> which <i>is included . . </i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				2.86
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Steph.
				<u>in Hp.</u>
				1.107D.
			</span></i></div>
